abstract: >-
  Tables compiled by The Epoch Institute, a free historical research site: a register of recorded states with their
  years, regions, capitals and dated relations to one another; power curves of states and empires; the people of the
  encyclopedia with their dates, regions and places of birth and death as Wikidata records them; songs in history;
  and inventions with what each built on. The files and their columns are described at
  https://the-epoch-institute.org/dataset. How the Institute works is set out at
  https://the-epoch-institute.org/method, and its corrections at https://the-epoch-institute.org/corrections.
